    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83443" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλᾰκ-ίτης</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλᾰκ-ίτας</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρτος, ὁ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flat</i> cake, <i><span class="en">
				Sophr.
				29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλακῖτις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>, ἡ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλακώδης</span>
			, a form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καδμεία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.220
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a kind of
			alum, ib.<i><span class="en">
				237
			</span></i>.</div>
